<topic template="Default" modified="2026-11-17T13:30:54.158+01:00" lasteditedby="robert" version="2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title>SET COMPATIBLE 命令</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET COMPATIBLE command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">SET COMPATIBLE 命令</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">控制与 FoxBASE+ 及其他 xBase 语言的兼容性。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">SET COMPATIBLE ON | OFF | FOXPLUS | DB4 | &amp;&lt;cMacro&gt;</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">ON | FOXPLUS<tab/>启用兼容模式。</para>
    <para styleclass="List">OFF | DB4<tab/>禁用兼容模式。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">备注</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">该值存储在运行时状态中，可以通过函数 <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetCompatible.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetCompatible()</link> 读取和更改。</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_SAFETY">SET SAFETY</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetCompatible.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetCompatible()</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
